# Regenerated on every `devcontainer up` since @devcontainers/cli 0.87 made
# lockfile generation the default; whatever launches this container passes its
# own features via --additional-features, which the CLI (rightly, since 0.86.1)
# excludes from the lockfile it writes here, so every session's `up` rewrites
# this file relative to whatever committed version came before it as noise.
.devcontainer/devcontainer-lock.json

